# Doom's benchmark (devplan/bench.md §12), installed in share/bench by dist/doom: the first demo of
# the IWAD played as fast as it renders (Chocolate Doom's -timedemo), without sound, full screen.
# One run a time: Doom plays the demo once.

[Bench games.doom.timedemo]
Exec=doom -timedemo demo1 -nosound
Tags=screen,long
Help=Doom's demo1 played as fast as it renders, without sound (frames a second)
Param.runs=1;Runs (Doom plays the demo once a run)
Param.warmup=0;Runs first, not kept
